# Segmented Date and Time Fields

Date and time fields support direct keyboard entry. Use Tab to move between segments and arrow keys to adjust each value. Date segments follow `locale`; `min`, `max`, and `readonly` are available. The range variants submit `name.start` and `name.end` in forms.

Currently available for Svelte only.

